export anchor TeamChat:
    description:
        Brightwork Chat, a made-up team chat app, in the channel design-crit.

    sidebar:
        Channels general, design-crit which is current, mobile-release with 4
        unread, billing-war-room with 1 mention, and random. Direct messages
        with Priya Nair who is online, Jonas Weber who is away and Aiko Tanaka
        who is offline.

    messages:
        - Priya Nair, 09:02, "Three hero options are up in Canvas. Thoughts by Monday?"
        - Aiko Tanaka, 09:05, "B reads best on phones. A feels busy."
        - Mara Okafor, 09:11, "Agree on B. Can we try the button in brand green?"
        - Priya Nair, 09:12, an image attachment homepage-hero-B.png
        - Jonas Weber, 09:20, "Unrelated, billing deploy is at 11:00, heads up"

    thread:
        A thread on Aiko's message has 3 replies, and reactions of a thumbs up
        from 3 people and an eyes reaction from 1.

    composer:
        A message field with "Message #design-crit", buttons for attach, emoji
        and send, and "Priya is typing" shown above it.
